# regress/artifacts/mvme187memcoob/.gitignore -- written by the mvme187memcoob landing.  The BULK of this folder stays
# uncommitted (the coordinator's artifact-selection rule of 2026-11-05: blobs never leave history; adding a file later is
# cheap): the per-variant session transcripts, build, apply and probe logs, codex reasoning streams and launcher logs below, and
# the uncited one-off files present at the landing -- 10559 files, still on disk.  A file a committed record cites is re-included
# by a `!` line.  ANY OTHER FILE IS NOT IGNORED -- an erratum or a new reading shows in `git status`: commit it.  Why each
# committed file is in: landing_20261105/ARTSET_memc_why.txt; the rule: landing_20261105/ARTSET_RULE.md.

# per-variant session transcripts
**/sessions*/**
**/*_sessions*/**

# build logs (per variant, and each table's base/HEAD/restore builds)
**/build_*.log

# patch-application logs, per variant
**/apply_*.err

# probe logs inside the table folders (per variant unless re-included below)
**/table*/probe*.out
**/table*/probe*.raw
**/*_table/probe*.out
**/*_table/probe*.raw

# codex reasoning streams and seat launcher logs
**/codex_*.err
**/cxlaunch.log
**/*.launch.log
**/*.launch[0-9]*.log

# table drivers' run logs
**/*_run.log
**/*_run_[a-z].log

